# the Eve web server answers with a page: Hello World, This is Eve (F-NET-02, first step)
** spec: library/machine.md#the-web-door
** The runner calls the command of the VM, not this script: see "command" and "client" below.
** The project has the layout of a single page application: the browser part is plain HTML, CSS and
** JavaScript in the folders of web/, the backend will be written in Eve. Step one serves files only.
driver e95_web_hello is
  process main is
    print "e95: the command --serve is tested, not this script";
  return;
end e95_web_hello;
